<https://hollo.social/@fedify/019f1e3a-2fc9-7d21-8483-19793f0b3d45> <https://www.w3.org/ns/activitystreams#content> "<p>The official account for the Fedify project is moving to <a  data-account-id=\"019f1e3a-3cc2-7a66-ac1a-db7893bf572d\" data-account-handle=\"@fedify@hackers.pub\" translate=\"no\" class=\"h-card u-url mention\" href=\"https://hackers.pub/@fedify\">@<span>fedify</span></a>. This account will be replaced by the new one. Followers should automatically follow the new account unless any issues occur.</p>\n" .
<https://hollo.social/@fedify/019f1e3a-2fc9-7d21-8483-19793f0b3d45> <https://www.w3.org/ns/activitystreams#content> "<p>The official account for the Fedify project is moving to <a  data-account-id=\"019f1e3a-3cc2-7a66-ac1a-db7893bf572d\" data-account-handle=\"@fedify@hackers.pub\" translate=\"no\" class=\"h-card u-url mention\" href=\"https://hackers.pub/@fedify\">@<span>fedify</span></a>. This account will be replaced by the new one. Followers should automatically follow the new account unless any issues occur.</p>\n"@en .
